00:05:25.980 --> 00:05:27.940
U dot v over v dot z.

00:05:27.940 --> 00:05:28.940
Good.

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:35.180
But you notice this is also the
same as u dot v over the length

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:37.430
