00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:35.740
is orthogonal to p itself.

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:41.620
That right angle is between e
and p, which is also

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:42.840
between e and v,

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:48.540
because p and v live on the same
line.

