01:13:48.450 --> 01:13:53.670
So the span of these three
vectors is the span of just the

01:13:53.670 --> 01:13:54.690
blue and orange.

01:13:54.690 --> 01:13:57.110
The pink one doesn't really
change the span.

01:13:57.110 --> 01:13:58.770
There's nothing special about
the pink one.

01:13:58.770 --> 01:14:00.190
I just picked on it arbitrarily,

01:14:00.190 --> 01:14:02.970
I could use the same argument
with the pink and blue.

01:14:02.970 --> 01:14:05.670
I can make the orange with the
pink and blue, so the span of

01:14:05.670 --> 01:14:09.510
the pink and blue is the same as
the span of all three of them.

01:14:09.510 --> 01:14:13.330
The configuration is subtly
different on the left, because

01:14:13.330 --> 01:14:17.190
the span of the blue and orange
is just a line, while the span

01:14:17.190 --> 01:14:20.090
